{{!-- Shared resource row: `CURRENT [editable] / [calculated maximum, grey]` —
      the design handoff's §1 "recurso com atual/máximo" pattern, shared by the
      character's Composure and Health and by the unit's Health. It REPLACES the
      old blue "current" chip that trailed the stat row (handoff §4).

      Only the current value is editable; the maximum is derived, so it is a
      SPAN, never a readonly input (v13 submits those). `status` is an optional
      state word (unhurt / wounded / broken) whose colour comes from
      `statusClass`. --}}
<div class="cs2-stat-row">
    <div class="cs2-stat-head">
        <span class="cs2-stat-label">{{label}}</span>
        {{#if note}}<span class="cs2-stat-note">{{note}}</span>{{/if}}
    </div>
    <div class="cs2-stat-fields">
        {{#if status}}<span class="cs2-stat-status {{statusClass}}">{{status}}</span>{{/if}}
        <span class="csv2-label">{{localize "CS.sheets.generalLabels.current"}}</span>
        <input name="{{currentName}}" type="text" value="{{current}}" title="{{localize 'CS.sheets.generalLabels.current'}}" data-dtype="Number"/>
        <span class="cs2-op">/</span>
        <span class="cs2-total" title="{{localize 'CS.sheets.generalLabels.max'}}">{{max}}</span>
    </div>
</div>
